OL,3,AIsrael confirms soldiers fired at car
OL,4,Ain which Hind Rajab was killed and
OL,5,Aopens criminal investigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli military has confirmed for
OL,8,Fthe first time that it opened fire on a
OL,9,Fcar carrying five-year-old Palestinian
OL,10,Fgirl Hind Rajab, who was killed along
OL,11,Fwith six relatives in Gaza in 2024.
OL,13,FRajab initially survived the attack and
OL,14,Fanswered a telephone call during which
OL,15,Fshe pleaded for help. The call lasted
OL,16,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
