OL,3,AIsrael confirms soldiers fired at car
OL,4,Ain which Hind Rajab was killed and
OL,5,Aopens criminal investigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn ambulance sent to reach her ` in a
OL,8,Fmove co-ordinated with the Israeli army
OL,9,F- was then shelled, killing two
OL,10,Fparamedics. Hind's body was recovered
OL,11,Fdays later, along with the others
OL,12,Fkilled.
OL,14,FIn a statement, the Israel Defense
OL,15,FForces (IDF) said that it would open a
OL,16,Fcriminal investigation into Hind, her
OL,17,Ffamily and the paramedics' killings, as
OL,18,Fwell as the killing of 15 Palestinians,
OL,19,Fincluding medics and a UN worker, in
OL,20,FMarch 2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
